; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐16
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_35_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:所有人已聚集在会客厅，<br>随后典狱长现身在众人面前。|#0202Adv16_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:很好，大家都到齐了吧。<br>方才已经通知过各位，<br>又发生了一起凶杀案。|#0202Adv16_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和上次一样，我们会举行先行投票。<br>要是让可疑人士销毁证据可就麻烦了。|#0202Adv16_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其实并不需要先行投票……不，甚至连审判都不需要。|#0202Adv16_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你这是什么意思？|#0202Adv16_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:凶手是谁很明显。<br>只能是拿着枪站在现场的艾玛！|#0202Adv16_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……可疑的是你啊，希罗。|#0202Adv16_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一直沉默不语的艾玛，低声喃喃道。|#0202Adv16_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你想说什么？|#0202Adv16_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是你约我在那个时间点见面。|#0202Adv16_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你从一开始就想陷害我吧。<br>|#0202Adv16_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:顿时少女们的视线都集中在我身上。|#0202Adv16_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根据我和艾玛刚才的对话，<br>我已经预料到她会这么说了。|#0202Adv16_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我毅然决然地接住了她的话。|#0202Adv16_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以呢？你的意思是<br>我杀害了可可，再嫁祸给你？|#0202Adv16_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv16_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们怒视彼此，视线交错。|#0202Adv16_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊——，可以请你们到审判时再争辩吗？<br>总之，现在请赶快开始投票。|#0202Adv16_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在典狱长的催促下，<br>少女们纷纷开始在手机上投票。|#0202Adv16_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说实话，<br>我完全不清楚发生了什么事。|#0202Adv16_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是我和艾玛的争吵<br>势必会导致一种投票结果——|#0202Adv16_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1

; モニター音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_3 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Stream MakeDefault:true HideOther:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

; パンパカパーン的な音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_34 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:会客厅的大屏幕亮起同时，<br>响起了滑稽的庆祝号角声。|#0202Adv16_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:30,30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:而后，画面上出现的是……<br>我和艾玛两人的相貌。|#0202Adv16_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Default MakeDefault:true HideOther:true
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#FFFFFF Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:5_1
@Wait WaitMode:0.3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，这可麻烦了。<br>希罗小姐和艾玛小姐票数相同，并列第一呢。<br>那么，先将你们二位关起来吧。|#0202Adv16_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们都要被关起来……？<br>这我不能接受。我不是凶手！|#0202Adv16_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:可就算你这么说……规定就是规定。<br>如果你接受不了，就在审判中自证清白吧。|#0202Adv16_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0202Adv16_Jailer001| AuthorId:Jailer RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守的手不由分说地<br>抓住我和艾玛。|#0202Adv16_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无法抵抗它巨大的力气，再加上被它堵住嘴巴，<br>只能一个劲地瞪着艾玛。|#0202Adv16_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:而艾玛也是同样瞪着我。|#0202Adv16_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

